-- RETIRED: consensus is derived from durable attestations. A function that
-- directly mutates one consensus leaf creates state no witness can reproduce and
-- bypasses the canonical fold/refold law. No caller exists in SQL, C, app,
-- scripts, or tests; keep the upgrade surface as DROP-only so old installations
-- lose the hazardous alternate implementation.
DROP FUNCTION IF EXISTS generation.decay(bytea, bytea, bytea, float8);
DROP FUNCTION IF EXISTS laplace.laplace_decay(bytea, bytea, bytea, float8);
